WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.144
Sometimes a teacher changes. Here is what that means.

2
00:00:06.144 --> 00:00:12.384
Our old teacher says goodbye. That teacher taught us a lot.

3
00:00:12.384 --> 00:00:16.344
It is okay to miss a teacher we liked.

4
00:00:16.344 --> 00:00:22.152
A new teacher arrives. They will have a different voice.

5
00:00:22.152 --> 00:00:28.176
They might have different rules. The rules will be explained.

6
00:00:28.176 --> 00:00:32.976
We can ask the new teacher: how do you want us to ...?

7
00:00:32.976 --> 00:00:37.968
The new teacher gets to know us, little by little.

8
00:00:37.968 --> 00:00:43.224
The class goes on, and we learn new things with the new teacher.

9
00:00:43.224 --> 00:00:51.432
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

